[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
For images of the web (a Lua script of nginx that converts them on the fly),
put this line into the main context of nginx.conf (not into http {}):

  env VIPS_BLOCK_UNTRUSTED=1;

Then libvips in the workers of nginx opens none of its untrusted loaders (the
vips format and CSV: nothing a browser sends); JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, HEIC and
AVIF are not affected. This libvips has no ImageMagick or GraphicsMagick.
EOM
}
]
